    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-ef626ff0-e0bc-463a-b5dd-f573cbdb0cca" n="0876" facs="#m-521b47d3-e87a-46af-bfca-ddff2c99132f" /><div xml:id="m-fcca27c8-de8c-48d1-8a04-700b15a82521">
            <lg xml:id="m-179007a9-ad55-451c-9aa3-6981fe6e8756">
              <l xml:id="m-13f929ce-825b-47ce-a649-9963a1f8dd19" facs="#m-891f34a4-6687-4852-9a4a-d05dc625006f" label="ambiguous">730</l><l xml:id="m-a387dfa9-cb4d-42c9-944f-4800ef9ce1e5" facs="#m-6b60c387-d97a-4cff-a3b8-849fcd315f01" label="ambiguous">Good Friday</l><l xml:id="m-879e1239-78b5-4522-85df-5cca82ca2a43" facs="#m-825f37f5-23b2-49e1-b159-b6a78b865549" label="lyrics-like">assistens ministrórum dedit ála-] mundo esset regnum meum, mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-febce17a-0f70-4ce5-9cdf-5cab8801d74a" facs="#m-00e775ec-0874-440a-af7a-7eddba721de1" label="lyrics-like">nistri mei útique decertárent, ut</l><l xml:id="m-f2d4c863-9404-4abc-9bbc-cbbd7e80287e" facs="#m-3ef98001-feb2-4ef0-a43c-8771181f8437" label="ambiguous">pam Jesu, dicens : S. Sic respon¬</l><l xml:id="m-9ea489be-20d3-43c4-9aaf-8b66e5f8ff1a" facs="#m-2ee8f9b7-1e81-4933-b359-52607f8f248f" label="lyrics-like">non tráderer Judaéis: nunc</l><l xml:id="m-3b94e092-a146-4531-baa8-37e6eca4e233" facs="#m-34ebe259-0d47-43e7-b9de-b0c25cfca666" label="lyrics-like">des pontifici? C. Respóndit ei</l><l xml:id="m-663659d8-7a16-4216-beb6-59f904329446" facs="#m-4ac8d556-c42d-4512-81ee-ca5183d073a2" label="ambiguous">autem regnum meum non est</l><l xml:id="m-08bb2cdd-9b5f-4334-86cf-0e47906d79f4" facs="#m-aa1eb486-1baf-43e4-937c-24f25f93440e" label="lyrics-like">Jesus : 4 Si male locútus sum,</l><l xml:id="m-b9c1d063-1c67-409d-9d4a-cebfd54523f2" facs="#m-3cafbdc2-cdb7-40b0-afed-a10b76665fb9" label="lyrics-like">testimónium pérhibe de malo:</l><l xml:id="m-e3ed97b2-7f6d-4520-bbed-b44db235879c" facs="#m-9947990a-7525-4bd5-bbf7-629fe4c77577" label="lyrics-like">hinc. C. Dixit itaque ei Pilátus:</l><l xml:id="m-ad081642-c236-470e-a146-f5dce0fb09c4" facs="#m-df85dd24-59e3-493d-8538-1104d74678e0" label="lyrics-like">S. Ergo Rex es tu?̃ C. Respóndit</l><l xml:id="m-e0cb6331-0109-425c-b695-69c172627af7" facs="#m-c388f304-f5ef-4f77-b114-426e67ef9200" label="ambiguous">si autem bene, quid me caedis?</l><l xml:id="m-d8615fa2-1569-4eba-a9b4-1dddab998380" facs="#m-8effba86-771d-49f2-9442-b427130cf7a2" label="ambiguous">Jesus : 4 Tu dicis quia Rex sum</l><l xml:id="m-2d7b2d6a-41b6-4ae1-84ca-54b6b54b7f0c" facs="#m-a4319ddc-05af-4e9c-ac0e-773b0099fb58" label="lyrics-like">C. Et misit éum Annas ligátum</l><l xml:id="m-374c9b5b-698f-4e1d-9b4d-496abf8fe745" facs="#m-1094c242-9f2d-4509-bc7b-9f3233a879ad" label="ambiguous">ego. Ego in hoc natus sum, et</l><l xml:id="m-61fb5fb7-cde3-4696-90bf-08c9a0d24d42" facs="#m-ca398edf-07be-47d6-80c5-79e04efed146" label="lyrics-like">ad Cáipham pontificem. Erat</l><l xml:id="m-3419722c-dd60-4e2e-aa30-4b8417eda67e" facs="#m-f0814a3b-12a0-40ee-a9a7-20856aa8e557" label="ambiguous">ad hoc veni in mundum, ut</l><l xml:id="m-019e7224-54f4-4f0e-a4c8-18ac793ed4b6" facs="#m-befafa69-0e6f-4c69-aaa2-ede82a0081ec" label="ambiguous">autem Simon Petrus stans et</l><l xml:id="m-039a551b-4f7e-443a-9812-09478aa6d2ff" facs="#m-c81ad671-566e-404a-b676-1feeb5962509" label="lyrics-like">calefáciens se. Dixérunt ergo ei:</l><l xml:id="m-4f96fe7d-cacd-4e9b-bf2f-7ed27e25ded3" facs="#m-f5f0c112-435f-45a8-bafb-662965858ac0" label="lyrics-like">testimónium perhibeam veritáti:</l><l xml:id="m-dee96b30-347c-41d9-aa51-d2c30549a23c" facs="#m-434cf70c-5d30-407b-ba42-85225143c3d1" label="ambiguous">s. Numquid et tu ex discipulis</l><l xml:id="m-e773d375-7a6f-4b3a-abbe-2a2a9ffceae8" facs="#m-ea4b2d00-2aed-4159-8754-6f9965658f0d" label="lyrics-like">omnis, qui est ex veritáte, audit</l><l xml:id="m-3f0ead38-a5c4-4139-84ab-77fb02683ed4" facs="#m-35686ed7-d54d-4b83-ac41-5eb0e779aef8" label="lyrics-like">vocem meam. C. Dicit ei Pilá¬</l><l xml:id="m-431507e7-e46e-417f-a051-0de39b00295f" facs="#m-f0cff58a-9b48-4556-ac39-36e00ae72a1c" label="lyrics-like">ejus es? C. Negávit ille, et dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-92e47fb6-7c05-404e-82bb-99344231976f" facs="#m-e632f411-7cb2-4064-b1a2-031b3138bd03" label="lyrics-like">tus : C. Quid est véritas? C. Et</l><l xml:id="m-0d2f7cd0-452a-4e39-a3b0-b1e61c30e9f7" facs="#m-03ab3490-bc8f-451f-9a38-0935cd0c726d" label="ambiguous">S. Non sum. C. Dicit ei unus</l><l xml:id="m-204a8491-b164-4d3f-a637-abc84e0dcce3" facs="#m-9be9afee-28c0-4bb8-8b23-bd2a6414adaa" label="ambiguous">cum hoc dixisset, sterum exivit</l><l xml:id="m-5abf823f-587b-4206-aae0-e9afcf980a29" facs="#m-45e345d0-8e88-4798-a0b5-aaeeed1c64a6" label="lyrics-like">ex servis pontificis, cognátus</l><l xml:id="m-fc46d5e4-0cc5-42e8-ad0c-fe0c99563c3f" facs="#m-f067a268-cce1-4e17-b005-9fc16fd4b547" label="lyrics-like">ad Judaéos, et dicit eis: S. Ego</l><l xml:id="m-027f5d2d-bdbb-4728-bc80-1c02e82ecc5e" facs="#m-c55cb2b2-a2ee-4704-9030-75d8a5de07af" label="ambiguous">ejus, cujus abscidit Petrus auri¬</l><l xml:id="m-d0861e88-da16-49e4-99cc-246921cc4a56" facs="#m-fec736a6-c360-42af-8f25-00b1626bb20b" label="lyrics-like">nullam invénio in eo causam.</l><l xml:id="m-ed2d5a50-a4e1-4e96-9c10-4e001a97f0cd" facs="#m-0bff45da-bb39-4e52-b2e2-e8b2773c4d95" label="ambiguous">culam: S. Nonne ego te vidi</l><l xml:id="m-147ff08c-1128-4584-bf47-1148cd74a652" facs="#m-3c232a39-814c-44cb-91cf-466b964dea41" label="ambiguous">in horto cum illo? C. Iterum</l><l xml:id="m-8db4a14d-9bb0-4cd1-922b-790378078d17" facs="#m-2dae35bd-21b6-40ef-a6a7-e8d2eb1a584f" label="lyrics-like">Est autem consuetúdo vobis ut</l><l xml:id="m-0ac66e09-c089-4a4b-bf08-ead8840ef31a" facs="#m-dd347818-72d4-49e1-9470-5c92ab074a09" label="lyrics-like">ergo negávit Petrus: et statim</l><l xml:id="m-be51b0b4-82f9-48ec-8712-80fa56301704" facs="#m-cf476922-97dd-4bf0-bdab-56bb5a80c23b" label="ambiguous">unum dimittam vobis in Pascha:</l><l xml:id="m-d9a3f2a1-7686-4dc2-9064-009eca90b980" facs="#m-000ca061-b904-4417-b1ea-bd7572be1802" label="lyrics-like">gallus cantávit.</l><l xml:id="m-c567e980-5930-467b-aa64-08ec2dd23851" facs="#m-8f52194b-06f1-42cc-8ab2-715a715ab494" label="ambiguous">vultis ergo dimittam vobis Re¬</l><l xml:id="m-814b79f5-4530-4959-9983-7302cd8f7cb2" facs="#m-4f7fc78e-794e-4510-9187-741c841b2a2b" label="lyrics-like">Addúcunt ergo Jesum a Cáipha</l><l xml:id="m-f4d2ebbe-074d-4360-80fe-448490051ca4" facs="#m-1516923e-340e-4b58-bf86-f711452f2482" label="lyrics-like">gem Judacórum? C. Clama¬</l><l xml:id="m-094cba5a-a5ea-4f7f-ae20-1e143b8c9af6" facs="#m-6796f97c-1c9e-42a6-b378-014a30b50de4" label="lyrics-like">vérunt ergo rursum omnes; di¬</l><l xml:id="m-70b73e9e-e3c0-4d76-8169-749ea924f344" facs="#m-b2fc77d6-9f7d-42fc-8770-a043887c5952" label="lyrics-like">in praetórium. Erat autem mane:</l><l xml:id="m-2231b7b5-8921-46cc-80e6-2619a4bb5237" facs="#m-969b0dae-1c03-43aa-9a6c-417ef14894ba" label="lyrics-like">céntes: S. Non hunc, sed Ba¬</l><l xml:id="m-86bc70d5-567a-4222-bbd6-87ccfc4f0e4d" facs="#m-229044f9-fbfe-4c8a-b7bf-156091713865" label="lyrics-like">et ipsi non introiérunt in praetó¬</l><l xml:id="m-1a9e1115-1e16-4232-a4f7-888020a5b19a" facs="#m-0f8a7c43-53a8-4a9e-bd60-2ad41076d341" label="lyrics-like">rábbam. C. Erat autem Baráb¬</l><l xml:id="m-2783e72c-eea7-4d08-82f4-8f14d2afaaad" facs="#m-b8924ee5-6e11-4534-a2ea-6abb8b0e2746" label="lyrics-like">rium, ut non contaminaréntur,</l><l xml:id="m-55f83aeb-bf7f-4e07-b52b-ff40113f228a" facs="#m-975183e4-191b-465f-be65-6c6e22900536" label="ambiguous">bas latro.</l><l xml:id="m-2b0de189-f38c-4a81-b5a1-716591be0e13" facs="#m-7d03ea3c-43eb-404b-8f3c-510d60991ad2" label="lyrics-like">sed ut manducárent Pascha. Exi¬</l><l xml:id="m-1117a118-641d-4484-844e-27182f600d78" facs="#m-dc2fbc06-f1d9-489c-997a-f69aef9e9c71" label="lyrics-like">Tunc ergo apprehéndit Pilátus</l><l xml:id="m-ee3ece0d-19bd-402f-8fc0-5d440cf2e17b" facs="#m-01b43db5-ba61-4a5e-b6f9-084ae539529c" label="lyrics-like">vit ergo Pilátus ad eos foras, et</l><l xml:id="m-72145f43-6902-4d27-9303-85877d2ab45e" facs="#m-5ab554ad-89d6-46cc-9192-49740ec50186" label="lyrics-like">Jesum, et flagellávit. Et milites</l><l xml:id="m-82f19995-8b5f-48c4-a488-a1f8d2ddac42" facs="#m-67fe8e85-9ab6-4894-b65d-b4775db1faf9" label="lyrics-like">dixit: S. Quam accusatiónem</l><l xml:id="m-9842ec8b-d46a-4300-8f11-a24e56620495" facs="#m-a5a59ce8-1f9f-40fa-bc3e-0c3ee129057f" label="lyrics-like">affértis advérsus hóminem hunc?</l><l xml:id="m-c069bc05-2938-4b1c-a375-d5d9b3a19985" facs="#m-e4255650-5855-465b-ba82-9651449cac0a" label="lyrics-like">plecténtes corónam de spinis,</l><l xml:id="m-2d0d41a9-f6a4-4243-aec8-3a688bfc9cb2" facs="#m-44bb647d-1ba6-40a8-8762-7f5977f96bf7" label="lyrics-like">C. Respondérunt et dixérunt ei:</l><l xml:id="m-2a141b8e-3953-410b-9684-e7a7fe146647" facs="#m-cb55ee01-eea9-473a-a904-4f087ccd15b8" label="lyrics-like">imposuérunt cápiti ejus: et veste</l><l xml:id="m-953b2627-d106-4196-a650-b199a241eb35" facs="#m-7a2393e2-39a6-44eb-baca-c391b4d10746" label="lyrics-like">S. si non esset hic malefáctor,</l><l xml:id="m-a1e4ffc0-ac45-478c-8ce2-2e73eb9d8cc1" facs="#m-b7e5418a-4ddc-46b5-83c3-2c4bac1828d2" label="lyrics-like">purpúrea circumdedérunt eum.</l><l xml:id="m-82d9d8ae-da94-4c14-8886-e30609385cc2" facs="#m-e2958a64-40d3-4bcf-ad61-2b22de1fc0e5" label="lyrics-like">non tibi tradidissémus eum.</l><l xml:id="m-9ce354db-1638-4d5e-90be-1c81f2dc150b" facs="#m-2d90e75c-b07b-4b99-a22b-d4d9a47f11c1" label="lyrics-like">Et veniébant ad eum, et dicé¬</l><l xml:id="m-855025ad-a1a1-4bbc-bc89-b037231f0328" facs="#m-ff0dec7a-6d0c-4792-9f69-16ae0209be8f" label="lyrics-like">C. Dixit ergo eis Pilátus:</l><l xml:id="m-1ed049d1-f774-41fd-8586-72cfd729028d" facs="#m-c511a0ec-4a29-4b22-9920-b21f12cb0d6b" label="lyrics-like">bant : S. Ave, Rex Judaeórum.</l><l xml:id="m-a2b88341-2cd7-4384-aa3e-8251860eb13a" facs="#m-7f269ba8-7308-482b-8979-14e739340874" label="lyrics-like">C. Et dabant el álapas. Exivit</l><l xml:id="m-50610cae-a978-4b1f-80eb-dc1291b5131d" facs="#m-31c007ff-c989-47e2-aa4b-ea2f57e1b4cd" label="lyrics-like">S. Accípite eum vos, et secún¬</l><l xml:id="m-5efba3ad-7db2-46fb-be7a-58ac6e224ce3" facs="#m-00a3e7be-5d0c-4ab8-ad50-f26b940a1ba7" label="lyrics-like">dum legem vestram judicáte</l><l xml:id="m-e103fa72-2876-4dc7-99f4-426a64f9151e" facs="#m-b404f991-790f-4994-9e10-66000ca58c9d" label="lyrics-like">ergo sterum Pilátus foras, et</l><l xml:id="m-cca54e56-5262-42b7-b4a0-e50a644da15d" facs="#m-f9918a1d-9299-4db3-8acc-0b99ba721588" label="lyrics-like">dicit eis: S. Ecce addúco vobis</l><l xml:id="m-b42c893c-a6dd-407b-a1c4-29177f8f85cb" facs="#m-e3e56fa2-1070-45e7-bbb1-bb25461be381" label="lyrics-like">eum. C. Dixérunt ergo ei Judaéi:</l><l xml:id="m-20529cd1-cb88-4c20-90fd-a4668cd46287" facs="#m-6281a492-bc88-4c55-9aca-c80a8d85851f" label="ambiguous">S. Nobis non licet interficere</l><l xml:id="m-3d61ae66-4f75-4e22-8a55-087684aebd06" facs="#m-0856a04c-f1a2-49af-ab59-d35ac60edd90" label="lyrics-like">eum foras, ut cognoscátis, quia</l><l xml:id="m-3a8ea8cf-43d7-41d5-9501-7a9c70d29620" facs="#m-67113dec-1efd-4a6b-83d9-bff1d3ae0f75" label="ambiguous">quemquam. C. Ut sermo Jesu</l><l xml:id="m-d276b978-03ff-4608-9ac5-2666cebf6a70" facs="#m-4478c768-1f07-4881-9f73-5c37a892a752" label="lyrics-like">nullam invénio in eo causam.</l><l xml:id="m-fc372adc-f3e4-4782-bf2b-06ba3f21a388" facs="#m-9737b5b6-c23d-4e57-b825-8983e8277ae5" label="lyrics-like">implerétur, quem dixit, signifi¬</l><l xml:id="m-624b5386-74f9-4169-b2ee-207b89a2737e" facs="#m-f6df60af-a040-4356-9360-f1eb2b39d1be" label="ambiguous">C. (Exivit ergo Jesus portans</l><l xml:id="m-11425405-ba91-4aa3-bf23-99a3908160df" facs="#m-04720a97-a80a-406b-a3d2-fdcf908113b7" label="lyrics-like">cans qua morte esset moritúrus.</l><l xml:id="m-5bbcc7c7-5d56-4420-bb89-ff3e03f1ee78" facs="#m-5cb7c2c0-71c4-486c-bf6f-ff9b7777897d" label="lyrics-like">corónam spineam et purpúreum</l><l xml:id="m-6f7c9e0f-55ef-47e0-88f2-7fca8e486deb" facs="#m-63b6af69-86b0-4b62-92bf-8c959f834b5e" label="lyrics-like">Introivit ergo iterum in praetó¬</l><l xml:id="m-4c4b509d-c7e7-4101-83ea-d7411645d1c2" facs="#m-076258ff-62f8-4ac6-8617-17a1e96694da" label="lyrics-like">vestiméntum.) Et dicit eis</l><l xml:id="m-19025eeb-4b97-4ebb-8d26-5bfb7a669dea" facs="#m-a78d2a5e-348f-4636-8792-ff1d99c44d28" label="lyrics-like">rium Pilátus, et vocávit Jesum,</l><l xml:id="m-dc9e6d77-317e-42a9-bf44-da2025fda795" facs="#m-bfcf65b0-6a1e-4f79-9cbc-df6581da4916" label="ambiguous">S. Ecce homo. C. Cum ergo</l><l xml:id="m-83dce964-b27b-48a2-8685-5c456dab7057" facs="#m-3804a2d4-5c6f-4dc5-9520-678f8ff6dc92" label="ambiguous">et dixit el: S. Tu es Rex</l><l xml:id="m-0c2c125b-a6aa-438f-b881-ef67a359455f" facs="#m-68c7bcb4-3071-4840-9834-cc938ecd9c01" label="ambiguous">vidissent eum pontifices et mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-52eefc11-fdf8-4819-9518-68786749023f" facs="#m-e3a8124a-c941-43e7-846c-8d93ae9ee6fc" label="lyrics-like">Judacórum? C. Respóndit le¬</l><l xml:id="m-cb140313-a696-436b-bcdb-aa21a160edeb" facs="#m-e3bf0da7-8f8e-4de6-9806-47ed02df7deb" label="lyrics-like">nístri, clamábant, dicéntes</l><l xml:id="m-ba4a51b8-c8ce-4cd9-892c-9c2cc481c37c" facs="#m-bc12c4df-cec7-4c0d-ac9a-8369d547d7bf" label="ambiguous">sus: 4 A temetipso hoc dicis,</l><l xml:id="m-e797d752-0d45-4b94-bb7b-2edb2bea1dee" facs="#m-92bf5baa-22f8-47ad-b625-1245af3bb1e2" label="ambiguous">S. Crucifige, crucifige eum.</l><l xml:id="m-7f626a77-b56e-438a-949e-9b3c3386753e" facs="#m-6727ae44-f694-4880-97cd-9c648cf84b78" label="lyrics-like">an áli dixérunt tibi de me?</l><l xml:id="m-89553e0d-5f09-40ad-b802-55827f5a6ca7" facs="#m-190b00bc-04e6-4098-a4d0-44a9f9e2c198" label="lyrics-like">C. Dicit eis Pilátus : S. Accipite</l><l xml:id="m-c700326f-228f-418a-b7dd-7e8e3cfe1466" facs="#m-1022a5dc-9e3f-4861-aab1-d87e237bf3f8" label="lyrics-like">C. Respóndit Pilátus : S. Num¬</l><l xml:id="m-ada965a9-e21b-43f2-a384-be69d181a07f" facs="#m-e2894bae-5284-444e-a51c-ceaba7baa6fe" label="ambiguous">eum vos, et crucifigite: ego</l><l xml:id="m-093a51d4-6e49-4663-bef2-b4efce46c59a" facs="#m-502e7ed5-0d61-4d45-9a34-adc865dcbd2e" label="lyrics-like">quid ego Judaéus sum? Gens</l><l xml:id="m-f8c921a7-5e2b-46e1-8381-ed47e2e532e5" facs="#m-919f2920-36c0-4145-b3b8-fea6625e53f6" label="lyrics-like">enim non invénio in eo causam.</l><l xml:id="m-de5c40e4-4e63-42e4-8896-779a5cbee4d3" facs="#m-eb1ea371-428d-4f63-b0e0-a389347d7123" label="lyrics-like">C. Respondérunt ei Judaéi</l><l xml:id="m-1feceb22-da3f-4903-894a-fe05cf1af6b2" facs="#m-4309fe7d-0781-4217-950a-01f3a5435710" label="lyrics-like">tua et pontffices tradidérunt te</l><l xml:id="m-7761f1a4-e23c-48eb-9a3c-50aecdc65280" facs="#m-0ab04423-7d6e-4c65-aebd-b6b59f4669c0" label="lyrics-like">mihi : quid fecisti? C. Respóndit</l><l xml:id="m-ec71f747-20e3-454c-862f-13f744e22ffe" facs="#m-82fa1361-7335-464e-93c0-3ae4cefe3cbb" label="lyrics-like">S. Nos legem habémus, et se¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ab55b2a-2832-48f5-a8e8-14f6c30310ae" facs="#m-217bb822-fdbd-4e32-b12a-46f29c505725" label="lyrics-like">cúndum legem debet mori, quia</l><l xml:id="m-28f0cfa3-5e22-4e47-b772-a364efa40043" facs="#m-0f63c177-183b-4834-8f60-b08c46e45932" label="ambiguous">Jesus: † Regnum meum non</l><l xml:id="m-189e9d2c-fa8c-4127-805f-586392a531ba" facs="#m-da921fe3-29d8-4137-aca6-e2b9e86fdc98" label="ambiguous">est de hoc mundo. Si ex hoc' Filium Dei se fecit. C. Cum ergo</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>